OL,3,GNEWSA'Massive team effort' as White
OL,4,AHorse gets refresh
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn much-loved hillside landmark is
OL,7,Fbeing revitalised with up to 30 tonnes
OL,8,Fof chalk thanks to a group of
OL,9,Fvolunteers.
OL,11,FThe Millennium White Horse on Roundway
OL,12,FHill near Devizes, created in 1999 for
OL,13,Fthe millennium, is in the process of
OL,14,Fbeing re-chalked by the National Grid
OL,15,Fand local people as part of a bigger
OL,16,Fproject in the area.
OL,18,FThe power company's project manager
OL,19,FAmardeep Malhi said the work had been a
OL,20,F"real challenge," but had been made
OL,21,Feasier through teamwork and
OL,22,Fcollaboration with local organisations.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
