OL,3,GNEWSA'Massive team effort' as White
OL,4,AHorse gets refresh
OL,5,
OL,6,FExpected to be finished by early
OL,7,FOctober, Devizes mayor Vanessa Tanner
OL,8,Fsaid locals had noticed the "iconic"
OL,9,Fhorse needed a clean.
